  "title": "Wendy&#39;s Quick Pasta and Lentils",
  "description": "Cook up an easy, hearty meal in just minutes with canned lentil soup stirred into crushed tomatoes, a saute of onion and garlic, chopped spinach and red pepper flakes. Let the mixture warm with tiny cooked pasta, then serve with a sprinkling of Parmesan.",
